{"4345750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Trials - Chapter Two", "steam_appid": 4345750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials - Chapter Two, is a new stand alone chapter in the choose your own adventure, horror visual novel series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345750/extras/7dd749877f0360bade44cdf1f1617529.avif?t=1783011738\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter Two is a complete enclosed story set in the Trials universe. You do not need to know or have played Chapter One to enjoy the second chapter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345750/extras/4b19026985d2ed1e727407caf256641c.poster.avif?t=1783011738\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345750/extras/4b19026985d2ed1e727407caf256641c.webm?t=1783011738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345750/extras/4b19026985d2ed1e727407caf256641c.mp4?t=1783011738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump to different forks in the story to make different choices without replaying the whole game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345750/extras/e42491fb77aabcdf901af450bb7a6f01.avif?t=1783011738\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345750/extras_big/e42491fb77aabcdf901af450bb7a6f01.webp?t=1783011738 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own choices to try and esca